# Resales relay — TLS termination + reverse proxy.
#
# Current hostname: sslip.io magic DNS (resolves 167-233-98-46.sslip.io
# → 167.233.98.46 without owning a zone). Let's Encrypt issuance is
# automatic via Caddy.
#
# MIGRATING TO A REAL SUBDOMAIN later (e.g. resales-relay.smartmovemarbella.com):
#   1. Add an A record: resales-relay.smartmovemarbella.com → 167.233.98.46
#   2. Replace the hostname on the first line below
#   3. `systemctl reload caddy` (new cert issues automatically)
#   4. Update RESALES_PROXY_URL in Vercel (Production + Preview) and .env.local
# Nothing else changes — the relay itself is hostname-agnostic.

167-233-98-46.sslip.io {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
